{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27123","headline":"赠神遘上人 · 周贺","name":"赠神遘上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草履蒲团山意存，坐看庭木长桐孙。\n行斋罢讲仍香气，布褐离牀带雨痕。\n夏满寻医还出寺，晴来晒疏暂开门。\n道情淡薄闲愁尽，霜色何因入鬓根。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27123.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27123","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}